OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA showery start to the Bank
OL,6,FHoliday, with a few heavy and possible
OL,7,Fthundery showers. Showers easing this
OL,8,Fafternoon allowing more in the way of
OL,9,Fbrightness to develop. Temperatures
OL,10,Fnear average.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FLargely dry this evening
OL,13,Facross the south with a mix of cloud
OL,14,Fand clear spells. Rather cloudy
OL,15,Ffurther north with spots of rain,
OL,16,Fespecially over the higher ground.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
