OL,3,GNorth West
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FA bright start in the south,
OL,6,Fbut cloudier skies further north
OL,7,Ftending to move southwards throughout
OL,8,Fthe day. Some showers possible,
OL,9,Fespecially in the north.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,12,FRemaining changeable with a band of
OL,13,Frain crossing the region on Wednesday.
OL,14,FA return to sunshine and showers on
OL,15,FThursday, with perhaps Friday largely
OL,16,Fdry and bright. Temperatures near
OL,17,Faverage.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
